@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 2. Kiem tra server - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 3. Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments

### 4a. Chi tiet bai tap - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1

### 4b. Khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999

### 4c. Sai rang buoc route - 404 framework
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/abc

### 5a. Nop hop le - 201 + Location (chay API moi truoc khi lap lai)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"dtc245200107","repositoryUrl":"https://github.com/hoangthikieuanh5-debug/CNTTK23E"}

### 5b. Body rong - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":""}

### 5c. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/repo"}

### 5d. Khong co Content-Type - 415
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/repo"}

### 5e. JSON hong - 400 framework
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001",

### 5f. Thieu repositoryUrl - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001"}

### 5g. Sai method - 405, Allow: GET
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1

### 5h. Bai tap 2 da dong (IsOpen=false) - 400 ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/2/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/repo"}

### 6a. Doc lai bai vua tao (gui 5a truoc) - 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6b. GUID khong ton tai - 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6c. Sau khi khoi dong lai API, gui lai 6a voi ID cu - 404
# Khong gui lai 5a truoc ca nay; ID cu van nam trong response cua REST Client.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 9a. Bai tap 3 da dong - 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv002"}

### 9b. Nop lan dau - 201
# @name createForDelete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv002"}

### 9c. Gui lai 9b - 409 DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv002"}

### 9d. Rut bai (gui 9b truoc) - 204 khong body
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createForDelete.response.body.$.id}}

### 9e. Gui lai DELETE - 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{createForDelete.response.body.$.id}}

### 9f. Nop lai sau khi rut - 201 voi ID moi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentCode":"SV002","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/sv002"}
